# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Names only here; never commit real values.
#
# Leave both empty to run on local sample data (no backend needed).
# Set both to use your Supabase project. These two values are public by
# design and are the only ones that may reach the browser. Row Level Security
# in the database is what protects the data.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# Never add a service role key, database password or payment secret here.
# The backup script reads SUPABASE_DB_URL from your shell or from GitHub
# Actions secrets, not from this file.
